<mj-text>Hello{{#if name}} {{name}}{{/if}},</mj-text>
<mj-text>We received a request to reset your {{productName}} password. Click the button below to choose a new one.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{link}}">Reset password</mj-button>
<mj-text font-size="13px" color="#6b7280">This link expires in 1 hour and can be used once. If you did not request a reset, you can ignore this email. Link: {{link}}</mj-text>
